{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play alone or team up with up to 4 players in local co-op. <i>(Supports Steam Remote Play Together)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Tinkerbot Modules</strong> \u2013 Customize your playstyle with 12 unique modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/tinkerbots.gif?t=1745012839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build &amp; Defend</strong> \u2013 Strategically place turrets, traps, and barricades during the preparation phase, then maintain and resupply your defenses when the enemies appears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/structures.gif?t=1745012839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Terrain &amp; Mazing Paths</strong> \u2013 Destroy obstacles and reshape the terrain to carve your own path. Take advantage of high ground and interact with diverse biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management &amp; Crafting</strong> \u2013 Collect materials, craft vital supplies, and keep your defenses operational at all cost!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/materials.gif?t=1745012839\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Evolving Enemies</strong> \u2013 Encounter machines that evolve through 4 distinct tiers: Rusted, Crude, Prime, and Corrupted, becoming more dangerous with each wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/enemies.gif?t=1745012839\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480340?t=1745012839","background_raw":"https:/